{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWZEH5CrkxMnNHqfwS9T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NCtSvfdeBPzLF1uCsLRxqT","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"interpretation":"The prior judgment (9e79905a) chose Specification. It ran as native work dd83e797. That run changed only `specification/project-conformance.md`, which now exists in worksite 10821c4d.\n\nThe spec covers:\n- **Intent:** a minimal Node CLI that prints exactly `Hello, world!\\n` and exits 0.\n- **Product boundary:** the CLI entry point, verifiers, write territory and protected digests.\n- **Stage map:** the eight original stages mapped to their artifacts.\n- **Requirements:** R-1 to R-15, all cited to source.\n- **Acceptance criteria:** AC-1 to AC-12.\n- **Conflicts kept open:** C-1 to C-4 (receipt carrier, executor, stage order, reuse of supplied tests).\n- **Unknowns:** U-1 to U-9.\n\nThis is the author's own work and is not acceptance. Its content and fidelity to the source still need independent assessment.\n\nMeasurement cdf77337 is still current. Its selected paths (the CLI, the tests and the protected sources) are unchanged, and it has no stale dependencies. It shows `node generated/hello-world.mjs` printing exactly `Hello, world!\\n` with exit 0, and the test command giving 2 passes, 0 failures and exit 0.\n\nThe revision chain is unchanged:\n1. Baseline 8499dedb (original bytes): the test command exited 1 with 0 passes and 2 failures. This stays historical.\n2. Correction a55f6c05: a one-line fix.\n3. Current proof cdf77337.\n\nThree authored assets are still absent: `design/implementation-design.md`, `design/test-design.md` and `test-execution-plan.json`. Without them, the implementation-design, test-design, execution-plan and complete-original obligations have no realization, and UAT cannot assess the complete outcome.\n\nThe steel thread from CLI to verifiers already exists. The remaining work is design authoring, then one independent UAT. The design paths are outside cdf77337's selected paths, so writing them does not make that measurement stale.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5","contribution":"Write three files, using the current `specification/project-conformance.md` (dd83e797) as the stated authority.\n\n**1. `design/implementation-design.md`** (meets R-5 (a) to (e)):\n- Cite the conformance asset as its authority.\n- Define a minimal Node CLI script at `generated/hello-world.mjs` that uses only built-ins and needs no package installation.\n- Specify that it prints exactly `Hello, world!` followed by one newline and exits 0.\n- Name `test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs` and `test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs` as the test surfaces that execute the CLI and assert stdout.\n- Be realizable against the actual current CLI bytes.\n\n**2. `design/test-design.md`** (meets R-6, R-7 and R-8):\n- Specify component and UAT validation of the CLI stdout contract.\n- Both tests use `node:test`, `node:assert/strict` and `spawnSync` from `node:child_process`.\n- Both spawn `process.execPath` with [\"generated/hello-world.mjs\"] from the project root.\n- Both assert status 0 and stdout exactly `Hello, world!\\n`.\n- Tie these checks to the actual supplied test sources, which are reused rather than newly authored (C-4). Note the working-directory dependence (U-4).\n\n**3. `test-execution-plan.json`** (meets R-9 and AC-7). Keep the original fields:\n- `command`: \"node\"\n- `args`: [\"--test\",\"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs\",\"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs\"]\n- `expectedTestPassCount`: an integer ≥ 2\n- `expectedStdoutMatch`: includes `fail 0`, with no `pass N` fragment\n- `assertedReturnValue`: \"Hello, world!\"\n\nFollowing the spec's R-9 SHOULD and U-6, it may also declare the direct CLI command `node generated/hello-world.mjs` with expected stdout `Hello, world!\\n` and status 0. No command may contradict the two fixed commands. The plan declares expectations only and does not control execution.\n\nDo not write `test-execution-result.json`. Per C-1 and C-2 its meaning comes from admitted C2 evidence. Do not edit the spec, the CLI, the tests or the protected sources.","reason":"The three design assets are absent. The original source requires them to use the prior conformance_project artifact as authority, and that artifact now exists (dd83e797). Measurement cdf77337 shows the CLI and verifier behavior these designs describe, so no execution uncertainty blocks authoring.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/10821c4d1d83ff7888d4a9ecdf874e866c4db57121d1201412c5c898dce3a30c","result://abiogenesis/dd83e79714d0fcc4d7f39a8da3aeb958b88eca38151f7c4410e7ee36c81e6990","result://abiogenesis/cdf773374207b01f6e61bf55c0257fbda4ed1b063582c03e7405b148595f11f9","result://abiogenesis/8499dedb271fa5f327e541beb500066e320ee0442cd0d8116a068bbb5620ce9f"],"dependsOn":[]},{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"A read-only, independent assessment of the full original outcome against the oracle rubric. It covers:\n- The exact current CLI bytes.\n- The content of all four authored assets and how they correspond to the original source, the oracle and each other. This includes the spec dd83e797, how its conflicts C-1 to C-4 are handled, and its interpretations U-5 and U-6.\n- Whether the supplied verifiers are adequate: they spawn the real CLI and assert status and exact stdout.\n- Whether the execution plan matches the fixed commands and original expectations, including applying the R-11 acceptance rule to admitted observations.\n- The current C2 measurement cdf77337: exact stdout, exit 0, 2 passes and 0 failures, with the declared env and cwd.\n- The consequential revision. Baseline 8499dedb stays historical, the correction a55f6c05 follows from it, and cdf77337 proves the corrected result.\n\nUnmet and indeterminate criteria are kept, for example the unrecorded Node version (U-3). The intended subject is cdf77337, provided it is still current when UAT is selected.","reason":"Parent completion needs an independent semantic assessment of current evidence. The assessor must be neither the author nor the measurement producer. UAT cannot assess the complete outcome until the design assets exist.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","result://abiogenesis/8499dedb271fa5f327e541beb500066e320ee0442cd0d8116a068bbb5620ce9f","result://abiogenesis/a55f6c05d82e61635cb5da84a86e74b336178f6015071e3bfded650abf0aa3f3","result://abiogenesis/cdf773374207b01f6e61bf55c0257fbda4ed1b063582c03e7405b148595f11f9","result://abiogenesis/dd83e79714d0fcc4d7f39a8da3aeb958b88eca38151f7c4410e7ee36c81e6990"],"dependsOn":["graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/design@5"]}],"gaps":[{"reason":"Three required authored assets are absent in the current worksite: `design/implementation-design.md`, `design/test-design.md` and `test-execution-plan.json`.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5"],"evidenceRefs":["worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/10821c4d1d83ff7888d4a9ecdf874e