igation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/10821c4d1d83ff7888d4a9ecdf874e866c4db57121d1201412c5c898dce3a30c\",\"result://abiogenesis/dd83e79714d0fcc4d7f39a8da3aeb958b88eca38151f7c4410e7ee36c81e6990\",\"result://abiogenesis/cdf773374207b01f6e61bf55c0257fbda4ed1b063582c03e7405b148595f11f9\",\"result://abiogenesis/8499dedb271fa5f327e541beb500066e320ee0442cd0d8116a068bbb5620ce9f\"],\"dependsOn\":[]},{\"graphFunctionRef\":\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5\",\"contribution\":\"A read-only, independent assessment of the full original outcome against the oracle rubric. It covers:\\n- The exact current CLI bytes.\\n- The content of all four authored assets and how they correspond to the original source, the oracle and each other. This includes the spec dd83e797, how its conflicts C-1 to C-4 are handled, and its interpretations U-5 and U-6.\\n- Whether the supplied verifiers are adequate: they spawn the real CLI and assert status and exact stdout.\\n- Whether the execution plan matches the fixed commands and original expectations, including applying the R-11 acceptance rule to admitted observations.\\n- The current C2 measurement cdf77337: exact stdout, exit 0, 2 passes and 0 failures, with the declared env and cwd.\\n- The consequential revision. Baseline 8499dedb stays historical, the correction a55f6c05 follows from it, and cdf77337 proves the corrected result.\\n\\nUnmet and indeterminate criteria are kept, for example the unrecorded Node version (U-3). The intended subject is cdf77337, provided it is still current when UAT is selected.\",\"reason\":\"Parent completion needs an independent semantic assessment of current evidence. The assessor must be neither the author nor the measurement producer. UAT cannot assess the complete outcome until the design assets exist.\",\"supportRefs\":[\"obligation://default-library-witness/compl